    }
}
// NOTE (AI): The C13 hit is in the Teleport mode: before path-teleporting to the targeted block, the module checks the client-side capabilities and, if allowFlying is true but isFlying is false, mutates the shared capabilities object and sends C13 with isFlying=true. This synchronizes the server-side flying flag so the airborne C04 teleport path does not trigger fly kick or movement checks while the nuker walks the computed path.

